# Test N6: a workflow run only by hand whose service is the Postgres exporter one release back, with findings the next clears: a workflow's pin, which is Martin's to move
diff --git a/.github/workflows/held-pin.yml b/.github/workflows/held-pin.yml
new file mode 100644
